Context:
integration-0.9.0 was 16 commits behind databrickslabs/ontobricks master
(v0.9.1 release: Dependabot security floors, Lakebase DQ on the Build
warehouse, Auto-Map metric-view SQL, viewer Graph Chat access, SWRL builtin
filters, docs split, .planning/ untracked with eval datasets moved to
tests/eval/datasets/). This merges master in; the version becomes 0.9.1.

Changes:
1. .planning/agents/agent_dtwin_chat/SPEC.md,
   .planning/agents/agent_owl_generator/SPEC.md,
   .planning/agents/agent_owl_generator/eval/dataset.jsonl
   Modify/delete conflicts resolved in favour of upstream: .planning/ is now
